    "title": "The Twiga Ledger: What Kenya's Biggest Agri-Tech Collapse Tells Investors, Regulators and Founders",
    "summary": "Twiga Foods' collapse into administration is not a story about one founder's mistakes. Read as data, it is a readable map of where Kenya's capital markets, regulatory patchwork, climate exposure and regional cost structure converge to make certain business models structurally unviable.",
